  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A reversible heat engine converts one-fourth of the heat input into work. When the temperature of the sink is reduced by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;its efficiency is doubled. The temperature in Kelvin of the source will be ___ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "208",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Efficiency of reversible engine is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>in</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>From above,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When the temperature of the sink is reduced by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;then its efficiency is doubled.</p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>52</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>52</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>52</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>52</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>208</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p>",
